      "comments": "Build Float32 RepairScore=Valid*(1+BC). Missing/reference-invalid pixels score 0; valid pixels score at least 1. Threshold 0.5 separates validity, while higher BC ranks donors. BC is a contrast heuristic, not calibrated orientation confidence; Float32 avoids integer threshold truncation.",
